# Vite outputs
#
# NOTE: dist/ is intentionally NOT ignored. soyaos/soyaos uses
#   //go:embed web/dist/*
# to ship the compiled SPA inside the main binary, and that import
# is satisfied by copying THIS repo's committed dist/ into the Go
# tree. CI keeps the two in sync; the trade-off (a slightly bigger
# git history) is accepted in exchange for a self-contained release.
dist-ssr/
*.local

